{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、\nお料理に関心が向きつつあって、\nお弁当を頑張ってるんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日外食ランチや\nコンビニだと高くつくし、\n健康面とか節約の意味でも\n良いかなって思って、、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでね！\nこの間、ハンバーグのお弁当を\n作ったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも『可愛くしようかな？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハート型にしたのに..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蓋を開けたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただのナゲット←←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝から頑張ったのに。。。\nと少し凹みました(´･Д･)」笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあでも美味しかったんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果オーライ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お料理も日々お勉強ですねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張ってお弁当習慣\n続けます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝時間ない時に\n簡単に出来るおすすめの具が\nあったら是非教えてくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日公開されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週に引き続き、\nお寺修業の続編です(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"修業中はＯＬ裏話なんかも\nお喋りしちゃってるのでよかったら\nみて下さいねっっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"竹箒の扱いはもう完璧☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、お馴染みの住職さんは\nとっても良い方でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかいろいろと\nココロに感じるものがあった\n修業だったな（´-`）.｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非\nお見逃しなく！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週末は名古屋握手会です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20日(土)の全握では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美彩先輩と\n年齢層高めのお姉さまレーンっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめましての方や\nみさみさーくるの方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話題に困ったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂で好きな曲や"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏の1番の思い出"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋のおススメの食べ物"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も緊張しますが、\n一緒に楽しみましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものおなじみの方は\n変わらずよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして21日(日)は個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４部と５部なので\n会いに来てくれる方は\nお間違えなく(o^^o)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部制に増えたから\nその分みなさんに会えるのが\n嬉しいなあ、、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日間、\nよろしくお願いします(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はこの辺で、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩からひめたん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/09/19/3587469/0012.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}